7. **NoBlobDataError** - No blob data in transaction
8. **BlobCountExceededError** - Too many blobs
9. **PriorityFeeGreaterThanMaxFeeError** - Priority fee > max fee
10. **EmptyAuthorizationListError** - Empty authorization list (EIP-7702)
11. **InitCodeTooLargeError** - Init code too large
12. **TransactionGasLimitExceededError** - Gas limit exceeds max (EIP-7825)

